# Two steps held (neither with a note, so the second is held too, not a
# length gesture): the lock pages edit the sound, with no lock and no lane
# (docs/15 §3.9); the steps toggle nothing when let go.
--button 0.05:SEQ
--key 0.10:2:100:0.6
--key 0.12:4:100:0.6
--turn 0.20:SELECT:1
--turn 0.25:SELECT:1
--turn 0.30:KNOB3:2
--button 1.00:PLAY/STOP
